// tests-lang-rest-b-04: a collection callback with a labeled-default
// parameter never fuses ("lambda call site ... not discovered — subtree
// node-walks"); without the label it does. The fixtures
// lang::collection::labeled_callback_* assert FuseExpect::Jit, which the
// outer fold satisfies, so the de-fuse is invisible to them.
#[native] array::map([10, 20, 30], |#foo: i64 = 42, x| foo + x)
